Hi Kate,

Using three different templates or using one template with all landmarks is not going to matter since you want to download the entire landmark data set. You can label the fixed landmarks with anatomical point names, or when you download, the point names will be S1, S2...and curves will be C.1.1, C.1.2..... according to how many semilandmarks you have; similar is the case with using the patch. Hope this helps.

Best,
Merin

