Dear all,

I just wanted to update on the problem - it's solved. I inferred branch lengths from two published phylogenies from which I constructed
the consensus tree. And now everything works smoothly.
I'm not getting a phylogenetic signal for shape - which is expected since I'm working on a few very closely related taxa.
But, I managed to test physignal on univariate data - length of aquatic period, and there I got a positive result.

I thank you again for your immense help, without this group and especially Marko and Mike, I'd still be stuck.

All the best,
Aleksandar

